# Walkthrough - Phase 72: Quantum Orchestration

Phase 72 marks the transition of the AppForge Swarm from a standalone node to a **Distributed Intelligence Mesh**. Each swarm instance can now synchronize its cognitive and economic state with other peers without a central authority.

## Key Accomplishments

### 1. P2P Resonance (Sovereign Sync)
The [P2PResonance](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/p2p_resonance.ts#15-153) core has been upgraded from a simulation to a functional raw WebSocket implementation. 
- **Decentralized Pulse:** Nodes now broadcast their `BOUNTY_SYNC`, `ECONOMY_SYNC`, and `BRAIN_SYNC` payloads to all connected peers.
- **Sovereign Handshaking:** Direct peer-to-peer connections using the [ws](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/universal_quantum_dist/index.js#46-57) protocol ensure high data gravity and zero dependency on cloud-based message brokers.

### 2. Mesh Topology & Discovery
The [NexusGateway](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/nexus_gateway.ts#5-68) now manages local mesh discovery:
- **Peer Discovery:** Automatically scans for other sovereign nodes on adjacent ports (11435-11437).
- **Connection Pooling:** Maintains an active mesh of peers, updating connection status in real-time.

### 3. Integrated Pulse Synchrony
The [intelligence_pulse.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/intelligence_pulse.ts) has been updated to include **Step 6: Mesh Synchronization**. At the end of every reality pulse, the node's latest brain weights, economic value, and bounty backlog are synchronized across the entire mesh.

